## Meaning as a recoverable transformation

Pantheon does not have to treat meaning as a static treasure hidden behind the correct word. Meaning can be modeled as the structure that survives lawful transformation and the consequences that structure affords:

\[
\operatorname{Meaning}(x)
\approx
\left\langle
I(x),
\mathcal{T}_I(x),
\mathcal{A}(x),
